  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">수조에 물을 받아서 배모양 고무찰흙을 띄웠습니다.<br>자로 물결파를 만들면 배모양 고무찰흙은 앞으로 나가지않고 위 아래로만 진동한다고 교과서에 있는것을 봤습니다.<br><br>그런데 실제해보니 배모양 고무찰흙도 마구 이동해서요ㅠㅠ어떻게 학생들에게 설명해야 할까요?<br><br>전공이 아닌 부분이라 너무 미숙합니다.<br>검색해도 잘 안나와서 질문올렸습니다ㅠㅠ감사합니다 선생님들ㅠㅠ</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvtfki00x7vjb3g9ygd1sr3hb@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvtfki00x7vjb3g9ygd1sr3hb/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33223582598&amp;signature=i9Op3UPOr%2BRmL6yoELfz8vGA8Xo%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvtfki00x7vjb3g9ygd1sr3hb?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2dGZraTAweDd2amIzZzl5Z2Qxc3IzaGIiLCJ0aWQiOiJhNWQwYjM2OS1jZmQzLTRhNzktOWJhZi02OGEzYzdiOTFiNDUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI4ODJ9.LijN0DIAkJHHmAk7BeoQzTafowbutskRSlDad8MpAs-KikVoHmGIPUCv8qI-0ZUOeanLRcYlAckUfwu4iku62Q&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
